if rand(25)
mpecho $I says 'No, I will not haggle. Yes, I will watch you try. It's the highlight of my day.'
else
if rand(33)
mpecho $I says 'Browsing is free. Touching is a deposit. Bleeding on the merchandise is a purchase.'
else
if rand(50)
mpecho $I says 'Everything here has killed at least one previous owner. Adds character, I find.'
else
mpecho $I eyes your inventory the way a vulture eyes a slow horse.
